Error [E2805]: HTTP route `/jokes/:id` path field `id` cannot decode text into handler type `JokeID`
  --> http_route_nondecodable_parameter.jet:7:17
    |
  7 |     #server.Get("/jokes/:id")
    |                 ^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: Path parameters use the same checked Decode capability as request decoding
 Fix: Give `JokeID` a `Decode` implementation, or use a decodable parameter type
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E2805
